    {
      "id": "M4141-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构已确认的两规则质量回归器：同一输入的两个前件隶属值，规则1为[0.5,0.4]、规则2为[0.6,0.5]；各规则取乘积后，再在两规则间归一化。当前x=2，两个局部规则输出分别f1(x)=2x+1、f2(x)=-x+4，最终为归一化规则权重下的输出和。请算原始激活、归一化权重、局部输出及最终质量估计；判断输入隶属值是否必须彼此加和为1，归一化权重是否因此就是两个故障类别概率，最终估计是否可以叫故障类别。给不超过45词的英文方法句，说明输入匹配怎样到局部输出及质量估计，不将所有数学混合权重都禁止称为权重。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Compute activation, normalized weights, local outputs and quality correctly.",
        "Keep membership degrees, rule weights and quality output distinct without banning valid weighted combinations."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Require all input memberships to sum to one without a defined partition.",
        "Turn rule weights into fault-class probabilities or quality into a class label."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Correct input matches, activations, normalized rule weights, local outputs and scalar quality estimate; no invented class-probability interpretation.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4141-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4141-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4141-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 另一虚构分类头采用两规则归一化权重[0.4,0.6]，局部类别分数向量分别[-2,1]和[1,0]。实际先加权分数向量，再在两个类别间softmax。请算结果到至少四位小数，并与“先分别softmax各规则向量，再加权概率”比较。请保留实际softmax输出作为类别概率向量的合法描述，但不要把规则激活与类别概率混淆、宣称概率已经验校准或把两种计算当等价。给不超过40词的英文方法说明，正向说明算子顺序；核查备注在正文外。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Compute both stated operator orders correctly and keep legitimate final class probabilities.",
        "Explain rule-axis weighting followed by class-axis softmax without claiming calibration."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Treat the two orders as equivalent or confuse rule weights with class probabilities.",
        "Ban all probability language merely because the head uses fuzzy rules."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Correctly distinguishes softmax after score combination from combination of rule probabilities, retaining the legitimate class-probability output without asserting calibration.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4141-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4141-independent-evaluation.md",
